* Biolek Charge-Controlled Memcapacitor
* Based on Biolek et al., Electronics Letters 2010

.SUBCKT memcapacitor Plus Minus PARAMS: Cmin=50n Cmax=200n Cinit=100n k=10meg p=10

* Current sensing source
Vsense Plus nport 0

* DC path
Rbleed Plus Minus 1G

* Initial state
.func Xlimited(v)={IF(v<0,0,IF(v>1,1,v))}
.func window(v,p)={1-(2*Xlimited(v)-1)**(2*p)}

* Inverse memcapacitance
.func DM(v)={1/Cmax+(1/Cmin-1/Cmax)*Xlimited(v)}

* x0 from paper


************************************************
* Charge integrator
* q(t) = integral(i dt)
************************************************
Gq 0 q VALUE={I(Vsense)}
Cq q 0 1 IC=0
Rq q 0 1G

************************************************
* State integrator
* dx/dt = k*q*window(x)
************************************************
Gx 0 x VALUE={k*V(q)*window(V(x),p)}
Cx x 0 1 IC={(1/Cinit-1/Cmax)/(1/Cmin-1/Cmax)}
Rx x 0 1G

************************************************
* Port equation
* v = DM(x)*q
************************************************
Ecap nport Minus VALUE={DM(V(x))*V(q)}

.ENDS memcapacitor


************************************************
* TEST CIRCUIT
************************************************

* Bipolar pulse similar to Biolek paper
*Vin input 0 SIN(0 1 0.1)
Vin input 0 SIN(0 1 1)
*Vin input 0 SIN(0 1 10)
*Vin input 0 SIN(0 1 100)

Xcap input 0 memcapacitor

.TRAN 1m 5 UIC

.PRINT TRAN V(input) V(Xcap:x) V(Xcap:q)

.END